{
  "name": "GRC evidence: Google Workspace",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8f780c76-6acd-5821-b46f-96c1eb765368",
      "name": "Every day at 06:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e5e7f3fb-9331-5f07-b00e-2c25fa9a6c8b",
              "name": "customer",
              "value": "my_customer",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "946df8a9-ae73-569f-a27d-98ae610807da",
              "name": "grc_url",
              "value": "https://grc.yourcompany.example",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1ae0a700-4cae-5116-8042-88b07fc89bde",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "EDIT THESE VALUES. grc_url is the address of your GRC platform.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://admin.googleapis.com/admin/directory/v1/users?customer={{ $('Settings').first().json.customer }}&maxResults=500&projection=basic",
        "options": {
          "pagination": {
            "pagination": {
              "paginationMode": "updateAParameterInEachRequest",
              "parameters": {
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "name": "pageToken",
                    "value": "={{ $response.body.nextPageToken }}"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "paginationCompleteWhen": "other",
              "completeExpression": "={{ !$response.body.nextPageToken }}",
              "limitPagesFetched": true,
              "maxRequests": 100
            }
          }
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "oAuth2Api"
      },
      "id": "b8724860-0e3e-5e9c-b5c3-9d890cd8f865",
      "name": "Users",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Each input item is one page. Keep only what the checks test.\nconst items = [];\nfor (const page of $input.all()) for (const u of (page.json.users || [])) items.push({ user: u.primaryEmail, suspended: !!(u.suspended || u.archived), is_admin: !!(u.isAdmin || u.isDelegatedAdmin), two_step_enrolled: !!u.isEnrolledIn2Sv, two_step_enforced: !!u.isEnforcedIn2Sv });\nif (!items.length) throw new Error('Google returned no users. Check the credential and its scope.');\nreturn [{ json: { checks: ['google_2sv_enrolled', 'google_admin_2sv'], source_ref: 'Google Workspace ' + $('Settings').first().json.customer + ' (n8n)', collected_at: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 19), items } }];"
      },
      "id": "21f3fd29-cf61-59cd-a3fc-b8a1148f7a2e",
      "name": "Shape users",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.grc_url }}/api/integrations/collect",
        "options": {},
        "method": "POST",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}"
      },
      "id": "763ca63b-3e0a-51e2-a97e-55dbd657a3df",
      "name": "Send to GRC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GRC evidence: Google Workspace\n1. Edit **Settings**.\n2. On *Users* choose an **OAuth2 API** credential for Google with the single scope `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/admin.directory.user.readonly`, authorised by a Workspace administrator.\n3. On *Send to GRC* choose a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer <GRC API token>`.\n4. Run once with **Execute workflow**, then switch it to Active.\n\nFeeds the checks `google_2sv_enrolled` and `google_admin_2sv`. Read-only.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "806db9c2-b1ac-5f05-9c15-565a6f549341",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -20
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every day at 06:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Users",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Users": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Shape users",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Shape users": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send to GRC",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}